      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation on the List.indexOf(Object) call in TransporterStack.write(LogisticalTransporterBase, FriendlyByteBuf), writeToUpdateTag, isFinal, getNext and getPrev: a first-occurrence position index (fastutil Object2IntOpenHashMap, putIfAbsent in list order) per TransporterStack for the current pathToTarget list, rebuilt when the list object or size changes; served only for ArrayList routes of >= 12 entries whose elements are null or exactly BlockPos and an argument that is exactly BlockPos or MutableBlockPos; else the original indexOf. Exact because Mekanism never changes a route list in place (audit in notes/mekanism_transport.md; every method involved is guarded); require = 0",
